@K14_DANMAKU_OKINA
SIF !IS_HERE([[隠岐奈]])
    RETURN
;check cirno skill, player skill, boosts cirno to S rank if player skill is at least A
;if player skill if two or more levels below, boost player to Cirno rank -1
IF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 - ABL:[[チルノ]]:戦闘能力 <= -2 ;player gets boosted
    CALL SPTALK, [[隠岐奈]], "笑顔", 0, @"「Ah hah hah! How interesting!」/「This could be a very interesting fight to witness.」", 1
    CALL SPTALK, [[隠岐奈]], "通常", 0, @"「It seems like it would be a little lopsided, however.」/「Let me make it a little more fair between the two of you.」", 1
    PRINTFORMDW As she speaks, Okina opens the door on your back, and you feel energy pouring through it.
    CALL SPTALK, [[隠岐奈]], "通常", 0, @"「Now, with the hidden god as your witness, reveal the noh of darkness danced between a human and a fairy!」", 1

    ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 = ABL:[[チルノ]]:戦闘能力 - 1
ELSEIF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 >= 4 && ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 >= ABL:[[チルノ]]:戦闘能力
    ;okina dialogue
    IF ABL:[[チルノ]]:戦闘能力 == 6
        CALL SPTALK, [[隠岐奈]], "通常", 0, @"「Incredible. Truly incredible.」/「Both of you have reached a level of power unheard of within Gensokyo.」", 1
        CALL SPTALK, [[隠岐奈]], "通常", 0, @"「I'm certain that a fight between the two of you would be an incredible sight to behold,/　but it looks like the blessings of your pervert god push things a little in your favor.」/「As the hidden god of hindrances, I cannot allow such an upstart god to simply do as it pleases in Gensokyo.」/「I will choose this fairy as my champion, and grant her my full blessings. Let us see the true power of your god today!」", 1
        PRINTFORMDW As Okina says this, she opens the door on Cirno's back, and attempts to draw out as much power as she possibly can.
        IF GETBIT(TIME:5, 3) && GETBIT(TIME:5, 0) ;snowstorm pushes it to Rank 7
            PRINTFORMDL Resonating with Cirno's power, the snowstorm grows even more intense, and the life force grows completely out of control.
            PRINTFORMDL You have never seen such immense power.
            PRINTFORMDW What stands before you is no longer a mere ice fairy. Whatever she has become, it can only be described as the "Strongest".
            ABL:[[チルノ]]:戦闘能力 = 7
            BONUS_DANMAKU_LIVES = 1 ;1 extra life
        ELSE ;nothing happens
            PRINTFORMDW However, it doesn't seem like much has changed. This may simply be the limit of Cirno's power.
        ENDIF
    ELSEIF ABL:[[チルノ]]:戦闘能力 == 5
        CALL SPTALK, [[隠岐奈]], "通常", 0, @"「How curious.」/「The fairy has managed to draw out much of her potential on her own.」/", 1
        CALL SPTALK, [[隠岐奈]], "笑顔", 0, @"「However, I want to see if she can reach even further heights. Let us see how much power a fairy can truly wield!」", 1
        PRINTFORMDW Okina opens the door on Cirno's back, and you feel an intense pressure coming from her.
        PRINTFORMDW Curiously, her skin remains unchanged this time. It seems her power has stabilized.
        CALL SPTALK, [[隠岐奈]], "通常", 0, @"「Now, face this human with all your might, and show me the true extent of the power lying deep within you!」", 1
        ABL:[[チルノ]]:戦闘能力 = 6
    ELSE
        CALL SPTALK, [[隠岐奈]], "笑顔", 0, @"「Ah hah hah! How interesting!」/「This could be a very interesting fight to witness.」", 1
        CALL SPTALK, [[隠岐奈]], "通常", 0, @"「It seems like it would be a little lopsided, however.」/「Let me make it a little more fair between the two of you.」", 1
        PRINTFORMDW Okina opens the door on Cirno's back, and her skin suddenly turns brown while you feel an intense pressure coming from her.
        SIF MARK:[[チルノ]]:反発刻印 ;satsui no hadou
            PRINTFORMDL You feel a strong murderous sensation coming from the transformed Cirno.
        SIF CFLAG:[[チルノ]]:差し替え適用 == 0
            CFLAG:[[チルノ]]:差し替え適用 = 1
        CALL SPTALK, [[チルノ]], "笑顔", 0, @"「Woah, I feel even more amazing than usual.」/「I'm gonna show you my true power today!」", 1
        CALL SPTALK, [[隠岐奈]], "通常", 0, @"「Now, with the hidden god as your witness, reveal the noh of darkness danced between a human and a fairy!」", 1
        ABL:[[チルノ]]:戦闘能力 = 5
    ENDIF
    K14_DANMAKU_POTENTIAL_UNLEASHED = 1
ENDIF

